      "content": "That's really frustrating. The whole point of using Lumina was having a seamless, tech-driven experience. If I have to wait for a human to wake up or get back to me just to confirm a flight status before I drop $50k on a deposit, it makes me feel like I'm not actually getting the \"premier\" service I'm paying for. \n\nLook, if the flight status is just a minor delay or a standard update, I'm not going to let it stop me from booking. Just give me your best professional assessment based on what you can see in the itinerary logs—is the arrival window still looking solid for the safari start, or should I hold off on the payment? I'm ready to hit 'send' on the wire right now if you think we're good.",
